35:59.840 --> 36:01.120
notre loyauté

36:01.120 --> 36:02.060
complète

36:02.060 --> 36:02.840
et radicale.

36:03.840 --> 36:04.320
Et donc,

36:05.360 --> 36:06.000
cette vertu

36:06.000 --> 36:06.660
